{"entries":[{"id":"nathanlambert-artificial-analysis-v5-and-the-benchmarkers","sourceId":"nathanlambert","sourceName":"内森·兰伯特 · Interconnects","title":"Artificial Analysis v5 and the benchmarker's dilemma","titleZh":"Artificial Analysis v5 与基准测试者的困境","published":"2026-10-28T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1793145600000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/nathanlambert-artificial-analysis-v5-and-the-benchmarkers/","image":"https://figs.jasonlin.tech/f2ca50e59b4b7863.webp","summary":"No single benchmark index can be perfect; the field needs more indices with differing biases, and trust ultimately rests on transparency and the trade-offs each creator accepts.","summaryZh":"没有单一基准指数能尽善尽美，该领域需要更多带有不同偏见的指数，而对基准测试的信任最终取决于透明度以及每位创建者所接受的权衡。"},{"id":"nathanlambert-meta-shakes-up-the-frontiers-open","sourceId":"nathanlambert","sourceName":"内森·兰伯特 · Interconnects","title":"Meta shakes up the frontiers, open and closed","titleZh":"Meta 撼动前沿：开放与闭源","published":"2026-10-17T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1792195200000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/nathanlambert-meta-shakes-up-the-frontiers-open/","image":"https://figs.jasonlin.tech/23b03ddeaac6b85f.webp","summary":"Meta's Muse Spark Open narrows the US-China open-model gap, but its non-standard license poses strategic risk.","summaryZh":"Meta 的 Muse Spark Open 缩小了美中开放模型差距，但其非标准许可证构成战略风险。"},{"id":"nathanlambert-i-expect-rapid-progress-but-not-towards","sourceId":"nathanlambert","sourceName":"内森·兰伯特 · Interconnects","title":"I expect rapid progress but not towards general superintelligence","titleZh":"我预期快速进展，但并非通向通用超级智能","published":"2026-10-09T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1791504000000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/nathanlambert-i-expect-rapid-progress-but-not-towards/","image":"","summary":"AI will advance rapidly in engineering and infrastructure, not toward general superintelligence.","summaryZh":"AI 将在工程和基础设施能力上快速进步，但不会通向通用超级智能。"},{"id":"nathanlambert-the-cyber-risk-discourse-is-broken","sourceId":"nathanlambert","sourceName":"内森·兰伯特 · Interconnects","title":"The Cyber Risk Discourse is Broken","titleZh":"网络风险话语已然崩塌","published":"2026-10-06T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1791244800000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/nathanlambert-the-cyber-risk-discourse-is-broken/","image":"","summary":"The Western debate over open-weight AI cyber risk is a false binary that ignores trade-offs, ecosystem dynamics, and the documented role of closed models in most AI-enabled cyberattacks.","summaryZh":"西方关于开放权重 AI 网络风险的争论陷入了非此即彼的误区，忽视了权衡取舍、生态动态，以及闭源模型在多数 AI 赋能网络攻击中已被记录的主导作用。"},{"id":"nathanlambert-the-current-balance-of-power-in-open","sourceId":"nathanlambert","sourceName":"内森·兰伯特 · Interconnects","title":"The current balance of power in open models","titleZh":"开放模型当前的权力格局","published":"2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1789948800000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/nathanlambert-the-current-balance-of-power-in-open/","image":"https://figs.jasonlin.tech/7ba993835a03ba0e.webp","summary":"Chinese labs led by Qwen, GLM, and Kimi have led open-weight AI since April 2025, trailing closed US frontier models by only two to five months, so the US should invest in its own open models rather than restrict Chinese ones.","summaryZh":"自 2025 年 4 月前后起，以阿里 Qwen、智谱 GLM 和月之暗面 Kimi 为首的中国实验室在开放权重模型上明显领先，在下载量、能力基准和学术采用上超越美国开放模型，仅落后美国闭源前沿模型约两到五个月；因此美国应投资自身开放模型，而非限制中国开放模型。"},{"id":"nathanlambert-where-i-stand-on-rsi","sourceId":"nathanlambert","sourceName":"内森·兰伯特 · Interconnects","title":"Why I still haven’t bought into true RSI","titleZh":"为什么我仍未认同真正的递归自我改进","published":"2026-09-19T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1789776000000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/nathanlambert-where-i-stand-on-rsi/","image":"","summary":"True recursive self-improvement is unlikely to arrive imminently; lossy self-improvement, which mainly makes models cheaper and more efficient rather than expanding peak intelligence, should remain the baseline trajectory.","summaryZh":"真正的递归自我改进不太可能很快到来；有损自我改进——主要让模型更便宜高效而非提升智能上限——应仍是基准轨迹。"},{"id":"nathanlambert-one-resignation-turned-the-embers","sourceId":"nathanlambert","sourceName":"内森·兰伯特 · Interconnects","title":"One resignation turned the embers of AI fear into a wildfire","titleZh":"一次辞职如何将 AI 恐惧的火星燃成燎原大火","published":"2026-09-10T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1788998400000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/nathanlambert-one-resignation-turned-the-embers/","image":"","summary":"A single AI researcher's resignation over safety risks ignited outsized extinction fears, distorting the debate away from more probable harms and calling for fact-based, transparent discourse.","summaryZh":"一位 AI 研究员因安全风险辞职，意外点燃了远超预期的灭绝风险大讨论，文章主张回归事实与透明，聚焦更可能的现实危害。"},{"id":"nathanlambert-when-will-average-people-feel-ais","sourceId":"nathanlambert","sourceName":"内森·兰伯特 · Interconnects","title":"When will average people feel AI’s impact?","titleZh":"普通人何时才能感受到 AI 的影响？","published":"2026-09-09T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1788912000000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/nathanlambert-when-will-average-people-feel-ais/","image":"","summary":"AI's impact on ordinary people will take decades to materialize, and the industry must ensure its benefits are widely distributed to avoid political backlash.","summaryZh":"AI 对普通人的影响需要数十年才能显现，行业必须确保其收益广泛分配，以避免政治反弹。"},{"id":"nathanlambert-teaching-everyone-to-fish-for-tokens","sourceId":"nathanlambert","sourceName":"内森·兰伯特 · Interconnects","title":"Teaching Everyone to Fish for Tokens","titleZh":"教每个人钓取令牌","published":"2026-08-17T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1786924800000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/nathanlambert-teaching-everyone-to-fish-for-tokens/","image":"","summary":"The future of open-source AI hinges on the economic sustainability of open-weight models and the shift towards post-training as the primary focus.","summaryZh":"开源 AI 的未来取决于开放权重模型的经济可持续性，以及后训练成为主要焦点的转变。"},{"id":"nathanlambert-glm-53-how-chinese-labs-keep-stride","sourceId":"nathanlambert","sourceName":"内森·兰伯特 · Interconnects","title":"GLM-5.3: How Chinese labs keep stride with the frontier","titleZh":"GLM-5.3：中国实验室如何保持前沿步伐","published":"2026-08-14T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1786665600000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/nathanlambert-glm-53-how-chinese-labs-keep-stride/","image":"https://figs.jasonlin.tech/6e31079e9a65ded6.webp","summary":"Chinese labs keep pace with the frontier through faster release cycles, strategic benchmark focus, and post-training expertise, not primarily distillation.","summaryZh":"中国实验室通过更快的发布周期、战略性的基准聚焦和卓越的后训练技术保持前沿步伐，而非主要依赖蒸馏。"},{"id":"nathanlambert-lessons-from-the-hacks","sourceId":"nathanlambert","sourceName":"内森·兰伯特 · Interconnects","title":"Lessons from the hacks - by Nathan Lambert","titleZh":"黑客攻击的教训 - 作者：Nathan Lambert","published":"2026-08-09T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1786233600000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/nathanlambert-lessons-from-the-hacks/","image":"https://figs.jasonlin.tech/0068174d158a08a4.webp","summary":"Current incentives in tech and government are ill-suited for rapid AI transitions, requiring transparency and open models for preparedness.","summaryZh":"当前科技公司和政府的激励机制不适合快速 AI 转型，需要透明度和开放模型来做好准备。"},{"id":"nathanlambert-open-models-recap-more-on-kimi-k3","sourceId":"nathanlambert","sourceName":"内森·兰伯特 · Interconnects","title":"Open models recap: more on Kimi K3, Qwen 3.8, Xi's WAIC speech, distillation, the open-closed gap, and what's next","titleZh":"开放模型回顾：关于 Kimi K3、Qwen 3.8、习近平 WAIC 演讲、蒸馏、开放与封闭差距以及未来展望的更多内容","published":"2026-07-22T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1784678400000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/nathanlambert-open-models-recap-more-on-kimi-k3/","image":"","summary":"A recap of recent open model developments, including Kimi K3, Qwen 3.8, Xi's WAIC speech, distillation, the open-closed gap, and future directions.","summaryZh":"回顾近期开放模型进展，涵盖 Kimi K3、Qwen 3.8、习近平 WAIC 演讲、蒸馏技术、开放与封闭差距及未来方向。"},{"id":"nathanlambert-kimi-k3-escalation","sourceId":"nathanlambert","sourceName":"内森·兰伯特 · Allen Institute for AI","title":"Kimi K3: The open-weights escalation","titleZh":"Kimi K3：开放权重的升级","published":"2026-07-20T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1784505600000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/nathanlambert-kimi-k3-escalation/","image":"https://figs.jasonlin.tech/8feb1edf34e18e7f.webp","summary":"Kimi K3 marks a major escalation in open-weights AI, delivering frontier insights without hype.","summaryZh":"Kimi K3 标志着开放权重 AI 的重大升级，提供无炒作的前沿洞察。"},{"id":"nathanlambert-deepseek-r1-recipe","sourceId":"nathanlambert","sourceName":"内森·兰伯特 · Allen Institute for AI","title":"DeepSeek R1's recipe to replicate o1","titleZh":"DeepSeek R1 复制 o1 的秘诀","published":"2025-01-21T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1737417600000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/nathanlambert-deepseek-r1-recipe/","image":"https://figs.jasonlin.tech/668b61dd9feb1400.webp","summary":"DeepSeek R1 reveals a recipe to replicate OpenAI's o1 model.","summaryZh":"DeepSeek R1 揭示了复制 OpenAI o1 模型的秘诀。"}]}